OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Apreparing terrorist act after major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe context for this is troubling and
OL,8,Fcomes amid a rising number of incidents
OL,9,Facross Europe of what's termed "hybrid
OL,10,Fwarfare", our security correspondent
OL,11,FFrank Gardner writes
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
